62080/extras/81098dad90bfbab8ca66e436e0d473bc.poster.avif?t=1737225663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762080/extras/81098dad90bfbab8ca66e436e0d473bc.webm?t=1737225663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762080/extras/81098dad90bfbab8ca66e436e0d473bc.mp4?t=1737225663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Funny and weird NPCs you can talk to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Retro inspired pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and collectibles to find. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762080/extras/d9e6213f4fbf9cd0c98038fdc57954eb.poster.avif?t=1737225663\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762080/extras/d9e6213f4fbf9cd0c98038fdc57954eb.webm?t=1737225663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762080/extras/d9e6213f4fbf9cd0c98038fdc57954eb.mp4?t=1737225663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an entirely solo project made by <strong>Krystian &quot;Felt&quot; Barszczewski</strong> (that's me! :D). This includes art, sound effects, coding (this game was made in Godot Engine), designing levels, and gameplay. Thanks to everyone who pushed me further on this journey with positive words and gave me advice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you will like this game ^^</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music used in the teaser: Winter - Vivaldi, Lud and Schlatts Musical Emporium, Conducted by Philip Milman.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore this charming rage platformer by throwing your head (the rock) and teleporting to it! Listen to the rock poking fun at you, look for secrets, and collect powerups. Find the witch that made the rock alive against its will, or lack of, and make her break the spell!",
